OL,3,ASetback for SpaceX Starship rocket's
OL,4,Adouble-catch test
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is the company's first attempt to
OL,7,Ffully recover its rocket, paving the
OL,8,Fway for making Starship fully reusable
OL,9,Fso it can fly repeatedly and reduce
OL,10,Fcosts.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
